- Record organizational expenses
- Manage expense approvals
- Track expense information
- Maintain financial records

### 8. Budget Management
- Create budgets
- Manage budget allocations
- Track financial utilization

### 9. Resource Management
- Manage organizational resources
- Track resource transactions
- Allocate resources
- Maintain resource movement records

### 10. Beneficiary Management
- Register beneficiaries
- Manage beneficiary information
- Associate beneficiaries with projects
- Record beneficiary assistance

### 11. Impact Management
- Maintain project impact updates
- Track community outcomes
- Generate impact information

