- Generate donation receipts
- Associate receipts with donations
- Retrieve receipt information

### 13. Dashboard
- Centralized dashboard endpoints
- Access relevant organizational information

### 14. Reports
- Generate organizational reports
- Restrict report access based on user roles
- Support report-related API operations

### 15. Audit Logs
- Maintain audit log records
- Store actor information
- Record action and entity details
- Store timestamps
- Preserve relevant change details
- Provide authorized audit-log listing and retrieval

